# Customizable Dynamic Gauge System

This phase implements a generic, highly customizable layout system where users can rearrange and configure gauges on the fly.

## Proposed Changes

### [Component] Domain & Configuration
#### [NEW] [gauge_config.dart](file:///c:/projects/claude+antigravity/projects/car_dash/lib/domain/models/gauge_config.dart)
- Model for gauge properties: `id`, `type`, `position`, `scale`, `accentColor`, `maxValue`.

### [Component] Generic Gauge Framework
#### [NEW] [gauge_layout_wrapper.dart](file:///c:/projects/claude+antigravity/projects/car_dash/lib/presentation/widgets/gauge_layout_wrapper.dart)
- A draggable wrapper for gauges.
- Implements `LongPress` for moving, `DoubleTap` for settings.
#### [MODIFY] [futuristic_gauge.dart](file:///c:/projects/claude+antigravity/projects/car_dash/lib/presentation/widgets/futuristic_gauge.dart)
- Refactor to take `GaugeConfig` and render based on its type.

### [Component] New Gauge Implementation
#### [NEW] [rpm_gauge_painter.dart](file:///c:/projects/claude+antigravity/projects/car_dash/lib/presentation/painters/rpm_gauge_painter.dart)
- Circular RPM gauge with red-line segments.
#### [NEW] [current_gauge_painter.dart](file:///c:/projects/claude+antigravity/projects/car_dash/lib/presentation/painters/current_gauge_painter.dart)
- Horizontal bar for amperage/voltage.

### [Component] Settings & Layout
#### [NEW] [settings_screen.dart](file:///c:/projects/claude+antigravity/projects/car_dash/lib/presentation/screens/settings_screen.dart)
- Interface to add/remove gauges and edit global themes.
#### [MODIFY] [main.dart](file:///c:/projects/claude+antigravity/projects/car_dash/lib/main.dart)
- Update to use a dynamic list of gauges managed by the controller.

## Verification Plan
### Automated Tests
- Test drag-and-drop mechanics using `browser_drag_pixel_to_pixel`.
- Verify persistence of layout after re-loading.
### Manual Verification
- Rearrange gauges and verify positions are saved.
- Check that RPM and Speed gauges respond uniquely to the mock data.
